{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17207420","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17207420","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:3:1720742001:1":{"text":"Did you have fun today, Peggy?","source_cn":"佩吉，怎么样，今天玩得开心吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A3893BC0921AAAD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1720742002:1":{"text":"It was alright... I made new friends and gained some fresh perspectives...","source_cn":"还可以吧……我认识了新朋友，也知道了很多以前不知道的事……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF208BADEC428A039","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1720742003:1":{"text":"Gwyneth... can I stay with you tonight? I... don't feel like going back to the palace just yet.","source_cn":"格温妮丝……我今晚能不能和你住一起？我……我还不想回宫。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x459F38EAE186B99A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1720742004:1":{"text":"Sure thing. I'm on duty tonight, though, so you'll have to make do with my tent. As for the palace...","source_cn":"当然可以，只不过今天轮到我值勤，只能委屈你挤一挤我的营...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3714F07CB8D20CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1720742004":{"text":"Sure thing. I'm on duty tonight, though, so you'll have to make do with my tent. As for the palace...","source_cn":"当然可以，只不过今天轮到我值勤，只能委屈你挤一挤我的营帐了。只是王宫那边……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3714F07CB8D20CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1720742005:1":{"text":"Thank you, Magister Merlin.","source_cn":"那就麻烦您了，梅林阁下。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x29D76397BDA804EE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Thank you, Magister Merlin.","female":"Thank you, Magister Merlin.","variant_male_record_index":"231735","variant_female_record_index":"231736","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1720742006:1":{"text":"Good night, Rowan and <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>.","source_cn":"晚安，罗万跟班，晚安，<style=stress><p...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF2739481010554A7","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Good night, Rowan and <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>.","female":"Good night, Rowan and <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>.","variant_male_record_index":"231737","variant_female_record_index":"231738","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1720742007:1":{"text":"*Yawn* I should head back and get some rest. Honestly, being your errand boy is more exhausting than running the Consortium, Peggy...","source_cn":"呼，我也得回去好好休息了，做佩吉你的跟班可比工作累多了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC196FE292BDAF88","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:11:1720742008:1":{"text":"After leaving the base, you meet the Queen at the p